116..191 Comment "/// The binary corolla\'s code holds `plus`, `plus` with its inputs swapped,"
192..271 Comment "/// `times` and `times` swapped. `cross` exchanges `plus` and `times` and fixes"
272..352 Comment "/// both swapped forms: it is its own inverse, so code univalence accepts it and"
353..423 Comment "/// the hand-built product is a path, but it does not commute with the"
424..469 Comment "/// corolla\'s input swap, so `ua` refuses it."
